## 📖 Overview

Welcome to the **[Metaverse Rang Language Translator](https://github.com/iranpsc/Metaverse-Rang-language-translator)** repository! 

**MetaRang (Metaverse Rang)** is a 3D intelligent parallel world designed for global interaction, education, commerce, and decentralized governance. Because MetaRang connects citizens across borders, providing an accurate, natural, and culturally appropriate user experience in multiple languages is one of our core priorities.

This public repository serves as the central hub for **developing, managing, and planning localization (`i18n`)** across the MetaRang platform. Community members, native speakers, translators, and developers worldwide are invited to review existing translations, improve phrasing, and help add new languages to meet the needs of our global community.

&lt;br /&gt;

## 🗺️ Supported Languages

Currently, the repository maintains full localization across **5 active languages** (`1,817` standardized translation keys per file):

| Language | Native Name | ISO Code | File Name | Direction | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :---: | :---: | :---: | :---: |
| **Persian** | فارسی | `fa` | `json-FA.json` | RTL | ✅ Active |
| **English** | English | `en` | `json-EN.json` | LTR | ✅ Active |
| **Arabic** | العربية | `ar` | `json-AR.json` | RTL | ✅ Active |
| **Russian** | Русский | `ru` (`ry`) | `json-RU.json` | LTR | ✅ Active |
| **Chinese (Simplified)** | 简体中文 | `zh` | `json-ZH.json` | LTR | ✅ Active |

